0..55 Comment "// A `break` and a `continue` inside a handled subject."
56..58 Comment "//"
59..133 Comment "// A handled scope holds its handler until its subject returns, so no jump"
134..168 Comment "// leaves it for a loop around it."
169..171 Comment "//"
172..247 Comment "// `broke` breaks and `again` continues out of the scope its handler holds,"
248..281 Comment "// and the lowering refuses each."
282..284 Comment "//"
285..340 Comment "// - see: corpus/ledger/diagnostics/AcrossHandler.gandr"
342..373 Comment "// Early exit\'s host interface."
